<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Panel de Gestión | Tu Asesor Social</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Montserrat', -apple-system, sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; color: #1f2937; }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        header h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
        header a { color: white; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.9; }
        main { max-width: 900px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
        .empty-state {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: #64748b;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Panel de Gestión — <%= usuario.nombre %></h1>
        <a href="/admin/logout">Cerrar sesión</a>
    </header>
    <main>
        <div class="empty-state">
            <p>Todavía no hay casos registrados.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">La gestión de casos (crear caso, actualizar hitos, agregar notas) se agrega en la siguiente fase.</p>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
